  "description": "Cloudflare R2 usage from the GraphQL Analytics API via cloudflare-exporter. Storage is the current object payload size. Operations: the exporter samples per UTC day, so 'today' is the current day and the monthly figures are the calendar month-to-date sum of daily peaks (panel time range 'this month'), matching Cloudflare billing; 'projected' extrapolates the 7-day average daily rate to a full month. Monthly free tiers: 1M Class A, 10M Class B.",
